    <<ad _ad>>

    You notice that <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> is just staring straight ahead, quiet. He doesn’t look at you when he speaks again. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Of course they left.”</span> He sighs once more, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I should have expected that from him. But I’m glad he cleared all the snakes out of my garden.”</span> He says, now making eye-contact with you, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Makes it much easier to plant the flowers.”</span> He says with a half-smile, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I’ll win this war, and I will have them begging for mercy. That’s a promise. But first, I need to plant more flowers.”</span> <br>
    <<socialChange "Zay" 3 1>>
